    "long_instructions": "#Project Work: Truth & Crediblity Meter\r\n\r\n**Create a scale that shows levels of trust** For example: High Trust → Check Carefully → Low Trust.\r\n1.  Design it in a way that fits your project style.\r\n2.  Describe each level of your tool\r\n\r\n\t**Consider:** \r\n\t- What makes an AI response more trustworthy?\r\n\t- Add tips and warning signs that mean “slow down and check”?\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n3. Add at least two actions someone should take before trusting AI.\r\n\r\n\t**For examples:**\r\n\t- Ask for sources\r\n\t- Add missing details\r\n\t- Cross-check with another source\r\n\t- Look for assumptions",
